{"t":"Ramps","s":"ramps-acf4a","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Insectoid_Hive_Stairs_66acb9.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><b>Ramps</b> are slopes that are meant for climbing.  They may not be as steep as stairs, but they are just as hard to get up.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Ramps\">Ramps</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th><small>Move</small>\n</th>\n<th><small>Walk</small>\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;\">Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Insectoid Hive Stairs\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Insectoid Hive Stairs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Insectoid_Hive_Stairs_66acb9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">If you walk on the higher part of it, you will appear on a floor upstairs.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ramp (Bamboo)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ramp (Bamboo)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ramp_Bamboo_12bff3.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">If you walk on the higher part of it, you will appear on a floor upstairs.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ramp (Basalt)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ramp (Basalt)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ramp_Basalt_cc85ec.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">If you walk on the higher part of it, you will appear on a floor upstairs.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ramp (Clay)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ramp (Clay)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ramp_Clay_d74eaa.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">If you walk on the higher part of it, you will appear on a floor upstairs.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ramp (Earth)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ramp (Earth)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ramp_Earth_35e89f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">If you walk on the higher part of it, you will appear on a floor upstairs.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ramp (Fiehonja)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ramp (Fiehonja)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ramp_Fiehonja_cf3b53.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">If you walk on the higher part of it, you will appear on a floor upstairs.. Some of these ramps, however, have crumbled over the ages and are incomplete.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ramp (Ice)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ramp (Ice)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ramp_Ice_cc1694.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">If you walk on the higher part of it, you will appear on a floor upstairs, be warned not to slip on the ice!\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ramp (Mossy)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ramp (Mossy)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ramp_Mossy_261dc9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">If you walk on the higher part of it, you will appear on a floor upstairs.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ramp (Muddy)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ramp (Muddy)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ramp_Muddy_e9d4cc.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">If you walk on the higher part of it, you will appear on a floor upstairs.. Some of these ramps, however, have crumbled over the ages and are incomplete.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ramp (Sandstone)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ramp (Sandstone)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ramp_Sandstone_8b2a32.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\